Automating Tests with Jenkins Pipelines!!!!!!

With Jenkins Pipelines, you can run automated tests as part of your CI/CD workflow—ensuring code quality before deployment.

How It Works:
- Define test stages in your Jenkinsfile
- Run unit, integration, or end-to-end tests automatically after builds
- Fail the pipeline if tests don’t pass, preventing bad code from shipping

Benefits:
- Early bug detection
- Consistent testing environment
- Faster feedback to developers

Tip: Integrate testing early to catch bugs before they reach production.
